01559   {\cf20 /* For J from 9 to 15, inclusive, we store COUNT[J] consecutive}\par
01560 {\cf20      values starting at START[J] with consecutive codes starting at}\par
01561 {\cf20      FIRSTCODE[J - 9].  In the primary table we need to point to the}\par
01562 {\cf20      secondary table, and the secondary table will be indexed by J - 9}\par
01563 {\cf20      bits.  We count down from 15 so that we install the larger}\par
01564 {\cf20      secondary tables first, as the smaller ones may be embedded in}\par
